{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43520","headline":"又溪馆听蝉联句 · 颜真卿","name":"又溪馆听蝉联句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高树多凉吹，疎蝉足断声。\n已催居客感，更使别人惊。\n晚夏犹知急，新秋别有情。\n危湍和不似，细管学难成。\n当斅附金重，无贪曜火明。\n青松四面落，白发一重生。\n向夕音弥厉，迎风翼更轻。\n单嘶出迥树，余响思空城。\n嘒唳松间坐，萧寥竹里行。\n如何长饮露，高洁未能名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"颜真卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43520.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43520","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}